      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Interpretation then describes pattern with evidence and exceptions. A scatter series of visitor counts twenty, forty, sixty and widths 100,140,120 centimetres is not a width increase at every step: the last point drops. A conclusion must retain that exception instead of rewriting the data into a perfect trend. A table, graph and written answer should all use the same values.",
