      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "The finished presentation should reconcile with the source table. Recompute means, totals, percentages and category assignments independently, then check each plotted value and label. A correct table can still produce a wrong graph if axes are swapped or a missing value is entered as zero. This cross-check is part of useful analysis rather than a reason to accept software output without inspection.",
